    PARTY `Art 92 the provider of the general-purpose AI model concerned` DOES `Art 92(5) supply the access requested` AT (Day (Date 1 10 2026))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 92(5) the duty of the provider of the general-purpose AI model concerned to supply the access requested` (Date 2 9 2026) TRUE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    PARTY `Art 92 the provider of the general-purpose AI model concerned` DOES `Art 92(5) supply the access requested` AT (Day (Date 2 10 2026))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 92(5) the duty of the provider of the general-purpose AI model concerned to supply the access requested` (Date 2 9 2026) TRUE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 2 10 2026))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 92(5) the duty of the provider of the general-purpose AI model concerned to supply the access requested` (Date 2 9 2026) FALSE (Date 1 9 2026) (Date 1 10 2026) AT (Day (Date 1 9 2026)) WITH
