§ `Article 93`

-- args: date asked, the measure, the request is necessary and appropriate, the evaluation under Article 92 has given rise to serious and substantiated concern of a systemic risk at Union level
#ASSERT `Art 93(1) the Commission may request the provider to take the measure` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 93(1)(a) take appropriate measures to comply with the obligations set out in Articles 53 and 54` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 93(1) the Commission may request the provider to take the measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 93(1)(a) take appropriate measures to comply with the obligations set out in Articles 53 and 54` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 93(1) the Commission may request the provider to take the measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 93(1)(a) take appropriate measures to comply with the obligations set out in Articles 53 and 54` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 93(1) the Commission may request the provider to take the measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 93(1)(c) restrict the making available on the market, withdraw or recall the model` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 93(1) the Commission may request the provider to take the measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 93(1)(c) restrict the making available on the market, withdraw or recall the model` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Point (b): mitigation measures need the serious and substantiated concern as well.
#ASSERT `Art 93(1) the Commission may request the provider to take the measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 93(1)(b) implement mitigation measures` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 93(1) the Commission may request the provider to take the measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 93(1)(b) implement mitigation measures` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 93(1) the Commission may request the provider to take the measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 93(1)(b) implement mitigation measures` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 93(1) the Commission may request the provider to take the measure` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 93(1)(b) implement mitigation measures` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Another measure: the list is not closed.
#ASSERT `Art 93(1) the Commission may request the provider to take the measure` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 93(1) another measure` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: date asked, a measure has not yet been requested
#ASSERT `Art 93(2) the AI Office may initiate a structured dialogue with the provider before a measure is requested` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 93(2) the AI Office may initiate a structured dialogue with the provider before a measure is requested` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 93(2) the AI Office may initiate a structured dialogue with the provider before a measure is requested` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
