#ASSERT `Art 93(3) the Commission may by decision make the commitments binding and declare that there are no further grounds for action` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 94`

-- args: date asked, the person is a provider of a general-purpose AI model
